# InnoQuest frontend environment template. Copy to .env and adjust. Never commit .env.
#
# Development: keep the relative path - Vite proxies /api to the local FastAPI
# backend (see vite.config.ts), which avoids CORS and keeps the HttpOnly session
# cookie working on the same origin.
#
# Production (Vercel): set the absolute API origin, e.g.
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://innoquest-api.onrender.com/api/v1
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
